The '''strange tablet''' can be found inside [[Osmumten]]'s burial chamber, which is accessible after defeating the final boss in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. It leads to a small chamber to the west that contains the [[strange chest]], accessible after using the [[Ancient key (Tombs of Amascut)|ancient key]] on it.

==Trivia==
* The golden engravings can be read as Morse code, which can be translated as "A secret lies ahead uwu".

